          "type": "text",
          "text": "A 180 m travelator moves at 0.4 m/s. A traveller walks at 1.6 m/s relative to the travelator in the opposite direction to its motion. Find the time in seconds taken by the traveller to walk from one end to the other."
        }
      ],
